==Battleground==
*1 [[The Face]] spawns.
*1 [[The Face]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[The Face]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*6 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 8~12 seconds<sup>240f~360f</sup>.
*5 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 40~44 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,320f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Duche]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 28~32 seconds<sup>840f~960f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 2~8 seconds<sup>60f~240f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Though the 3 Faces may look intimidating, they can be easily stalled using meatshields and chipped at by fast units such as [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]]. The other enemies hardly pose a threat except for One Horn which can be countered by [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red Cats]] such as [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]].

